<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Hungary T-bill yields seen rising.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Hungary T-bill yields seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on Hungary's discount Treasury yields are expected to rise at this week's auctions, while government bond yields may move slightly either way, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month discount Treasury bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday, three-year bonds of the 1999/D series and seven years bonds of the 2003/F series on Thursday.</p>
